@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@bookId = 1

### List books
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books

### Add a book (use the returned ID below)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"The Hobbit","author":"J. R. R. Tolkien","publicationYear":1937,"quantity":5}

### Get one book
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### Replace all editable fields
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"The Hobbit","author":"J. R. R. Tolkien","publicationYear":1937,"quantity":8}

### Invalid input: 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":" ","author":"","publicationYear":0,"quantity":-1}

### Delete the book
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}

### Deleted or missing book: 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/books/{{bookId}}
